1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,380
Robots assume Earth's physics.

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:07,208
Sol Zero drops one into a simulated world with an unknown force law.

3
00:00:07,208 --> 00:00:09,765
Its Earth-physics first shot misses.

4
00:00:10,365 --> 00:00:13,546
So an AI lab of specialist agents takes over.

5
00:00:13,546 --> 00:00:17,789
It gets twelve experiments, and it chooses every one itself.

6
00:00:18,389 --> 00:00:23,522
Before each measurement, it pre-registers predictions for every rival law.

7
00:00:23,522 --> 00:00:26,366
One predicted two point three six metres.

8
00:00:26,366 --> 00:00:29,071
The robot measured zero point five six.

9
00:00:29,071 --> 00:00:29,695
Rejected.

10
00:00:30,295 --> 00:00:32,534
Evidence changed the plan six times.

11
00:00:32,534 --> 00:00:36,823
After ten experiments, the lab decided it knew enough, and committed.

12
00:00:37,423 --> 00:00:38,648
One firing table.

13
00:00:38,648 --> 00:00:41,386
Five untouched targets, one shot each.

14
00:00:41,386 --> 00:00:44,269
The server graded five hits out of five,

15
00:00:44,269 --> 00:00:47,727
including three beyond the range it ever tested.

16
00:00:48,327 --> 00:00:53,033
Every prediction, measurement and decision is in an auditable ledger.

17
00:00:53,033 --> 00:00:56,647
One recorded development run, replayed in simulation.

